<!--Q5-->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para>
        Explain your reasoning for your answer to number 4 and whether the equations \((3x + 5 = 15)\) and \((6x + 15 = 60)\) are equivalent.
      </para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here: </para>
  <para>Compare your answer: Your answer may vary, but here is a sample: </para>
    <para>No. Each term in the first equation was multiplied by a different number to get equation two.</para>
  </solution></exercise>
<!--Interaction End -->
</section>
